  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d68\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pobzxom.png\" alt=\"Kinetic Hosting\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></span></a><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>隱藏護甲：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">想欣賞你帥氣的皮膚以及其他玩家的美麗造型嗎？這個資源包正是為你量身打造的。本資源包的主要目的是讓來自不同模組的護甲變為透明。不僅如此，它同樣適用於原版護甲。</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>模組相容性：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>支援模組列表：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>Better Nether</li>\n<li>Better End</li>\n<li>Adventurez</li>\n<li>Environmentz</li>\n<li>The Twilight Forest</li>\n<li>Paradise Lost</li>\n<li>Create</li>\n<li>The Aether</li>\n<li>The Midnight</li>\n<li>Alex's Mobs</li>\n<li>Ad Astra</li>\n<li>Advanced Netherite</li>\n<li>Immersive Armors</li>\n<li>Wizards (RPG Series)</li>\n<li>L Ender's Cataclysm</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">想在基岩版上安裝嗎？請前往 Planet Minecraft！- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fhidden-armor-for-various-mods%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">點我</a></span></p>",
